{"id":"68a80369b215cba0","group":"72","path":"72/72-ex-per-union-not-transitive.md","title":"两个PER的并可以失去传递性","display":"ex-per-union-not-transitive — 两个PER的并可以失去传递性","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-ex-per-union-not-transitive","aliases":["72-ex-per-union-not-transitive"],"display":"ex-per-union-not-transitive — 两个PER的并可以失去传递性","depends_on":["[[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X PER closure constraints; local three-element counterexample","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-ex-per-union-not-transitive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-ex-per-union-not-transitive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-per-union-not-transitive — 两个PER的并可以失去传递性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9d782aac0c1a67b9\" href=\"?note=9d782aac0c1a67b9\" title=\"72-df-vper-lattice-operations\">72-df-vper-lattice-operations</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X PER closure constraints; local three-element counterexample"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:=\\{0,1,2\\}\">\\(T:=\\{0,1,2\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Downarrow:=\\{\\langle t,t\\rangle:t\\in T\\}\">\\(\\Downarrow:=\\{\\langle t,t\\rangle:t\\in T\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak e:=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak e:=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle\\)</span>。R、S由下式给出。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R:=\\{0,1\\}^2,\\qquad S:=\\{1,2\\}^2,\\qquad R,S\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R:=\\{0,1\\}^2,\\qquad S:=\\{1,2\\}^2,\\qquad R,S\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle0,1\\rangle,\\langle1,2\\rangle\\in R\\cup S,\\qquad\\langle0,2\\rangle\\notin R\\cup S,\\qquad\nR\\cup S\\notin\\operatorname{PER}(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle0,1\\rangle,\\langle1,2\\rangle\\in R\\cup S,\\qquad\\langle0,2\\rangle\\notin R\\cup S,\\qquad\nR\\cup S\\notin\\operatorname{PER}(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}\\{R,S\\}=T^2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}\\{R,S\\}=T^2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>身份求值的 Kleene 相等就是身份相等，因此两个平方关系均值相容。并中缺少0到2的边而有两步路径，故不传递；任一 PER 上界必须补出0到2及其对称边，连同已有边便为T²。该有限例验证一般并与有向并的差别。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-vper-lattice-operations","status":"resolved","id":"9d782aac0c1a67b9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T:=\\{0,1,2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Downarrow:=\\{\\langle t,t\\rangle:t\\in T\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak e:=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"R:=\\{0,1\\}^2,\\qquad S:=\\{1,2\\}^2,\\qquad R,S\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e).","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle0,1\\rangle,\\langle1,2\\rangle\\in R\\cup S,\\qquad\\langle0,2\\rangle\\notin R\\cup S,\\qquad\nR\\cup S\\notin\\operatorname{PER}(T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}\\{R,S\\}=T^2.","display":true}],"bytes":1475,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]] · [[72-ex-per-union-not-transitive]] · [[72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence]] · [[72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]] · [[72-thm-system-f-church-iteration]] · [[72-thm-system-f-empty-type]] · [[72-thm-vper-directed-union]] · [[72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]] · [[72-ex-per-union-not-transitive]] · [[72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence]] · [[72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]] · [[72-thm-system-f-church-iteration]] · [[72-thm-system-f-empty-type]] · [[72-thm-vper-directed-union]] · [[72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-83","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df